  "body": "This PR adds a `notificationclose` event to the service worker API, fired for persistent notifications closed by the user. This should satisfy #31 and marco-c/wp-web-push#63.\n\nRight now, the _action_ attribute would be set to null. As an alternative, we might want to split the `Notification` object into two different objects: `NotificationClick` and `NotificationClose`.\n",
